<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Macrovision started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Macrovision started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Cowen &amp; Co said it initiated coverage of Macrovision Corp as a buy.</p>
<p>-- set a price target of $12 a share.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Macrovision launched its initial public offering on March 13.</p>
<p>-- Macrovision lost 1/8 to nine.</p>
</text>
